Z||000007||bHooper||05-29-2000||09:58 PM||||i found a new problem today!  this one may not be severe, but it is a little wierd.<P>the trunk release switch, hasnt worked since i replaced the new altenator on wednesday night!  in fact i noticed, today, that if the car is off and i press the switch... the e brake light comes on!!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><P>whats up with that!?!?||||reg||1
Z||000008||Phaeton||05-30-2000||01:36 AM||||Manual tranny Fiero's have the trunk release wired through the emergency brake for safety, when the release button is held down current feeds back through the brake indicator lamp.<BR>This is normal, it shouldn't be normal, but it is.||||reg||12
