Z||000010||fiero56||05-30-2000||09:26 AM||||William Thorn was having a similar stall condition with one of his Fieros. The car, would not idle on its own. The gas pedal had to be continually held down slightly or the car would die. Made it quite difficult to shift without stalling between shifts or waiting at stop lights etc.  We reset the ECM and the car worked perfectly until it was started up cold. Then the stall came back. He replaced the TPS and it works great again.||||reg||1
